---
import UtilityLayout from "../layouts/utility-layout.astro"
import { SITE_DISPLAY_NAME } from "@/lib/site-url"

const pageTitle = `About the Secure Online Portal | ${SITE_DISPLAY_NAME}`
const pageDescription = `About EBC Flex — the secure online portal for your accounts and services.`
---

<UtilityLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} pageName="About" canonicalPath="/about">
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <div class="border-b border-[var(--layout-border)] pb-6">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--layout-text)] tracking-tight mb-3">About EBC Flex</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-[var(--layout-muted)] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        The secure portal for your tax-advantaged spending accounts — HSA, FSA, and HRA — in one place.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 py-2">
      <div class="p-4 bg-[var(--layout-card-subtle)] border border-[var(--layout-border)] rounded-lg text-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--layout-text)]">HSA</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--layout-muted)] mt-1">Health Savings</div></div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-[var(--layout-card-subtle)] border border-[var(--layout-border)] rounded-lg text-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--layout-text)]">FSA</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--layout-muted)] mt-1">Flexible Spending</div></div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-[var(--layout-card-subtle)] border border-[var(--layout-border)] rounded-lg text-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--layout-text)]">HRA</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--layout-muted)] mt-1">Health Reimbursement</div></div>
      <div class="p-4 bg-[var(--layout-card-subtle)] border border-[var(--layout-border)] rounded-lg text-center"><div class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Cards</div><div class="text-xs text-[var(--layout-muted)] mt-1">Benefits Debit</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-[var(--layout-text)] leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Your Accounts, One Sign In</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
        EBC Flex gives you one secure place to manage the tax-advantaged accounts your employer
        provides. Check balances, submit claims, upload receipts, track reimbursements, and manage
        your benefits debit card — all without paperwork or waiting for statements in the mail.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
        Whether you are paying for a doctor visit with your card, filing a claim for a pharmacy
        purchase, or planning ahead for next year's contributions, the portal keeps the details of
        every account visible and current throughout the year.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">Built for Real Life</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
        Eligible expense guidance, plan deadlines, and substantiation requirements are published in
        one place so you know what qualifies before you spend. When a claim needs documentation,
        the upload flow walks you through it and shows the status while it is reviewed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--layout-text)]">What You Can Expect</h2>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      The portal is designed around clarity and control. Information is organized so the answers to
      everyday questions are visible without digging, and status indicators show where each request
      stands at every step. When something needs your attention, notices appear alongside the
      records they relate to rather than in a separate inbox.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      Accessibility and mobile responsiveness are built in, so the same experience works across
      screen sizes and assistive technologies. Support is available when you need it — see the
      Contact page for the channels that fit the urgency of your question.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      Security is a shared responsibility: the platform protects the data behind strong controls,
      and a few good habits on your side complete the picture. Keep your contact details current so
      verification messages reach you, choose passwords you do not reuse elsewhere, and review your
      account records periodically. Together these steps keep your information accurate and your
      access yours alone.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[var(--layout-muted)]">
      Explore the other pages in this section for details on services, security, and support.
      Everything you need to understand how the portal works is published here, kept current as the
      platform evolves.
    </p>
  </div>
</UtilityLayout>
